<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/color> skos:definition "The vocabulary module publishing Hexplain Register — Colour Space terms, its imports and associated validation declarations."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Load to obtain the concepts of this register. A profile binds its schemes to the properties they supply with hexplain:usesRegister; the aspect the values serve does not import it. Use concept IRIs as values; concept schemes and collections organize those values rather than describing parsed instances."@en .
rcol:BT2020 rdfs:label "ITU-R BT.2020"@en ;
    skos:definition "Identifier for color interpretation associated with the BT.2020 ultra-high-definition television convention; this does not by itself choose an HDR transfer function."@en .
rcol:BT601 rdfs:label "ITU-R BT.601"@en ;
    skos:definition "Identifier for color interpretation associated with the BT.601 television-system convention; the profile must supply the applicable variant and signal range."@en .
rcol:BT709 rdfs:label "ITU-R BT.709"@en ;
    skos:definition "Identifier for color interpretation associated with the BT.709 high-definition television convention; transfer and range details must be retained by the profile."@en .
rcol:ColorSpaceScheme rdfs:label "Colour Space Register"@en ;
    skos:definition "The controlled concept scheme grouping colour space values. Membership identifies the applicable value set; raw format codes are defined by profiles rather than by this scheme."@en .
rcol:sRGB rdfs:label "sRGB"@en ;
    skos:definition "Identifier for the sRGB color-space convention. Channel coding and embedding of any color profile remain format-specific."@en .
